So busy laboring for humanity's sake.

00:02:51.052 --> 00:02:53.052
that these letters of affairs go to rack and ruin.

00:02:53.868 --> 00:02:55.348
In fact, he is practically broke.

00:02:56.012 --> 00:02:59.332
Too busy, I suppose, even to take the ordinate precautions about the moon storm.

00:03:00.156 --> 00:03:00.656
